	"Description": "[img]https://i.ibb.co/Mgp77nr/Untitled176-20240907193459.png[/img]\n<br />[center]\uFEFF[size=3]Farm buildings included in this mod are the following:[/size]\n<br />[b][i]-Farmhouse 1, 2, &amp; 3\n<br />- Stable\u00A0\n<br />- Coop\n<br />- Barn\n<br />- Mill\n<br />- Silo\n<br />- Greenhouse\n<br />- Shipping Bin\u00A0\n<br />- Mailbox\n<br />- Slime Hutch (different looks for 1.5 and 1.6)\n<br />- 1 look for all the Cabin types\n<br />- Fishpond\n<br />- Shed\n<br />- Well\n<br />- SVE Buildings (Grandpa's Shed, Premium Barn &amp; Coop, Winery)\n<br />\n<br />[/i][/b][size=3]________________________________________________________________________________________________________________[/size]\n<br />\n<br />[b][i][size=4]COMPATIBILITY:[/size][/i][/b]\n<br />[size=3]- This mod should be compatible with different CP Farm Buildings retexture mods as long as you 'turn off' the farm buildings that you don't want or you set it to 'false'.[/size]\n<br />[size=3]- Compatible with SDV 1.6 &amp; 1.5 Mobile.[/size]\n<br />\n<br />[size=3]________________________________________________________________________________________________________________[/size]\n<br />\n<br />[b][i][size=4]INSTALLATION:[/size][/i][/b]\n<br />[size=3]1. Download and extract the mod files.[/size]\n<br />[size=3]2. Move the extracted files to your Mods folder.[/size]\n<br />[size=3]3. Launch the game.[/size]\n<br />\n<br />[size=3]________________________________________________________________________________________________________________[/size]\n<br />\n<br />[b][i][size=4]NOTES:[/size][/i][/b][/center]\n<br />[center][size=3]- Please let me know if there are any issues.\n<br />- For CP, If u want to toggle off/on the Shipping Bin, I recommend you do it in the interface and not while in your save, as it will not work entirely.[/size]\n<br />[size=3]- If you want to support me, just do the thing below[/size]\n<br />[size=3]- STREAM MISAMO 'IDENTITY' OUT ON YT NOW![/size][/center]\n<br />",
